{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S03、S07、S13等段落的感受描述仍然偏密，尤其短时段里，观众可能来不及消化部分细节；X的短词更容易快速掠读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然感受文字更多，但【】提供了明确的视觉锚点，感受文字又通过大小层级和音乐时点分散呈现，不必一次读完所有内容。它不仅让我知道人物每一段在想什么，还让我理解他为什么会从不服气、怀念、孤独和反复动摇，逐渐走到带着想念继续生活；音乐的具体变化也能与人物心理相互印证。X的短词扫起来很快，但不少感受只是并列标签，缺少发生的过程、情绪转折和彼此之间的联系，细腻程度与整体理解都不如Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d4baeb3d-7b37-414f-bb3d-df457af0434a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T025555462255Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:56:21.781568+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a0bf062a42f71fac7cdfe1d6c55c26b8ddf790a9b0dbcdb5f0a02d3a6f58df8a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c